OL,3,GNEWSA'My thumb almost delayed a Batman
OL,4,Afilm'
OL,5,
OL,6,FVin Burnham has made a name for herself
OL,7,Fas a costume designer behind some big
OL,8,FHollywood blockbusters and hits on both
OL,9,Fthe stage and screen.
OL,11,FAnd her decades-long career has seen
OL,12,Fher collect a rich seam of stories,
OL,13,Fincluding the time she nearly
OL,14,Faccidentally delayed the filming of a
OL,15,FBatman movie.
OL,17,FBurnham helped create the iconic
OL,18,FBatsuit worn by Michael Keaton in Tim
OL,19,FBurton's Batman, which she later
OL,20,Frefined for the sequel Batman Returns.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
