OL,3,GNEWSA'My thumb almost delayed a Batman
OL,4,Afilm'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the very first day of filming
OL,7,FBatman, she said she was in the
OL,8,Fdressing room getting the cowl ready
OL,9,Fwhen she mistakenly put her thumb
OL,10,Fthrough the front of it.
